# Project standing orders

Before non-trivial work, read:

1. [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)
2. [docs/constitution.md](../../docs/constitution.md)

Non-trivial changes need an Agent Note under `.agents/notes/{lifecycle}/{class}/`.

Experiments: predictions are committed in `docs/experiments/planned/` before any run. Never add `## Results` there. Follow [docs/experiments/AGENTS.md](../../docs/experiments/AGENTS.md) and `.agents/skills/run-experiment/SKILL.md`.

After note or experiment edits, run `python scripts/verify_template.py` and report the result. Failures are errors, not hints.
